[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=frameeyeosc panel
Name[ja]=frameeyeosc パネル（目の送信の設定）
Comment=Change frameeyeosc's eye tracking settings from the SteamVR dashboard. Launch again while running to open the panel.
Comment[ja]=SteamVR のダッシュボードから frameeyeosc の設定を変える。常駐中にもう一度起動するとパネルを開く
# The installer replaces Exec with the binary's absolute path (Steam may start it without ~/.local/bin in PATH)
Exec=@BINARY@
Icon=frameeyeosc-panel
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;
